  "details": "I think VRChat would benefit from an in-game creation system similar to Rec Room’s Maker Pen, allowing players to build their own worlds and games directly inside VRChat without needing Unity or a powerful PC. A beginner-friendly building area available to Quest and PC users could encourage more creativity, bring in new creators, and give players more unique games and experiences to enjoy. This could help VRChat grow its community by making game creation accessible to everyone, not just experienced developers. �",
